Note on the demo data and the compliance controls
-------------------------------------------------

The borrower records in `data/call_list.csv` and in the sample workbook are
entirely synthetic. Phone numbers follow a sequential placeholder pattern
(+9198000000xx) and no real person's data is present.

The compliance gate implements the author's reading of RBI recovery-agent norms,
the DPDP Act 2023 and TRAI UCC regulations for the purposes of a demonstration.
It is not legal advice and has not been reviewed by counsel. Anyone deploying
this against real borrowers should have the controls reviewed by their own
compliance function.
